      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please understand that any burn with blisters needs professional assessment, especially since it was boiling water. While aloe or coconut oil might feel soothing, they are not sterile and can trap heat or introduce infection into a serious burn. If you cannot get to a clinic, try a cool compress wrapped in a clean cloth, but monitor it closely for signs of increasing redness or fever. For pain relief while you wait, over-the-counter ibuprofen can help manage the discomfort.",
