      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the ibuprofen isn't really helping that much and the stinging is getting worse. i'm really scared of it getting infected or something. if i can't go to the doctor tonight, can i at least put some antibiotic ointment on it or even just some honey? i read somewhere that honey is amazing for healing wounds and it's better than anything from a pharmacy. it's just so painful i can't even think straight.",
